-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC # Governance and Observability
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Governance and observability with Unity Catalog are fundamental for robust, scalable, and secure data and AI operations across modern cloud platforms, delivering centralized, technical control over discovery, access management, lineage, and quality monitoring for all data and AI assets. By providing a unified metadata layer and fine-grained privilege model, UC allows organizations to enforce consistent policies, audit usage, and monitor data flows at every level. Observability is unlocked through system tables, which expose operational and usage metrics, lineage, and data quality insights. This unified approach not only streamlines compliance and reduces operational risk, but also gives data engineers and platform teams the tools to optimize performance, manage costs, support collaboration, and ensure trust in the data pipeline—all without vendor lock-in or fragmented silo management.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC <div style="border-left: 4px solid #ff9800; background: #fff3e0; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0;">
